Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 17:26:21 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] logging: identify coin statistics cursor read failures

Retain non-dropping Error, exact function-name diagnostic and immediate
false/nullopt propagation when a coin cursor fails to read its key/value.
No hashing, encoding, accounting, iteration or UTXO state changes.

Add one public ComputeUTXOStats case with virtual coin-view cursors that
fail GetKey or GetValue. Check actual error records, nullopt propagation,
short-circuit read counts and no Next after failure; an empty successful
view remains accepted. Uses regtest genesis lookup with no chain mutation.
This is cursor error propagation coverage, not disk-corruption validation.

Shared eCash owner (original diagnostic3a3d9942a46 predates ABC1fb7db17).
Source-only event lint/diff checks pass; native case NOT_COMPILED/NOT_RUN.
No new field, formatter or API. Sealed381/current intake unchanged.

